Importantly, `iou=.5` is **not** a confidence threshold: it ignores boxes in the same class with overlap of 50% or greater to reduce duplicate detections [S2]. The supplied evidence does not establish which confidence argument or result attributes you should use.","citations":["S4","S2"]}
